
# Add the second row product to the cart and verify it matches


// Add Product To The Cart
* Find Element Where "selectorTypeCss" is "secondRowProductCss" then click
* Verify Windows Count Equals To "expectedWindowCount"
* Assertion|Verify Redirection To Product Page
* Switch To "productWindowIndex" Window
* Store Element Text "selectorTypeXpath" "productTitleXpath" as "productNameStoreKey"
* Find Element Where "selectorTypeCss" is "addToCartButtonCss" then click
* Verify Element where "selectorTypeCss" is "cartPopupCss"
* Move to "defaultMouseX" , "defaultMouseY" then click
* Assertion|Verify Product Added To Cart

// Open Cart
* Find Element Where "selectorTypeId" is "shoppingCartId" then click

// Control The Product Inside The Cart
* Assertion|Verify Product Visible In Cart
* Verify Element where "selectorTypeCss" is "cartProductNameCss"
* Verify Element where "selectorTypeCss" is "cartProductVariantCss"
* Expect "selectorTypeCss" "cartProductNameCss" to contain "productNameStoreKey"